name": "1gRrYe.png", "id": "649494149168060", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974624_649494152501393_4889968777875161088_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=E9faWIL3D_oQ7kNvwFBV_M6&_nc_oc=AdqlalB_c_LtsSRFdodL5FeDMpBvj32MZJebvsiKVzQ6l8yxSY1EyFI6u-jpnOY4ZuE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQE1HsJEB4R9HvbPTFzuj2ADrZpltn9ruokeoasVV8BF0w&oe=6A859B58"}, {"file_name": "aDU9NY.png", "id": "513503572678353", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974624_513503576011686_5452742568917860352_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=X-d2lmA9Ts4Q7kNvwHJvkUh&_nc_oc=Adqi4n3Af1NEotydHrIrwRpPS-NbxucCnSK3wCjhwBp46tmPsA5Sht_sX8x7fOg4bpA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQF2uBwMXR6iOvUFhdtPjo7nA1OwMat462tPrV8Vhw0qUw&oe=6A85853E"}, {"file_name": "d5e4uO.png", "id": "233096617897309", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38982699_233096621230642_1541719454822432768_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=XmxlAkkP4OYQ7kNvwEvdqqg&_nc_oc=AdrmCj-t686lgUXVco4iwjO7zyGb-_5qDq1nMeqsvMAgQGeCHgoyxJJI4DXTrKJrKf8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQER6pz391bxIwyFeSDIEgW0toDjOudLhF-IFC95oIHitw&oe=6A8586BD"}, {"file_name": "PS1tWP.png", "id": "223941032361146", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974555_223941035694479_8181425666768502784_n.png?_nc_cat=108&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=UfoWCfLE330Q7kNvwGLlbB9&_nc_oc=AdopRjw3HRZL0X300dP7rK2d_5RkxJBRysBxgtaxK8NWiX0Nic0ItzLbfec9Am3Ymcw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQF4M4U2OUmn5FMh-NxbW8TvFRuW5ZdRitxhdJfG2hBoBg&oe=6A858008"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "/tmp/RTeFWd", "id": "276552923350738", "uri": "https://scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031433_276552926684071_5398554272214286336_n.png?_nc_cat=100&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=rrgMC9gF_sAQ7kNvwH2CoI0&_nc_oc=AdpfxLl0WSZFHllx9shQMKp20WvwRum4UCJEfPYKCrT6CyPHbZXti5dq-cAYqy0LpVs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lhr11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQHZALvidALHsjto3q0J36DXaF6XhkHHC7vM2aM8ocEoMg&oe=6A8598C9"}, "display_name": "Winery Tour in Georgia", "keywords": ["Wine", "Travel", "WineryTour", "Food", "History"], "long_description": "Georgian winemaking method is a part of UNESCO Intangible Heritage. It is the longest uninterrupted tradition of creating wine in the world. Georgia is also one of the oldest winegrowing countries - the pips of the grapes that have been found at Shulaveri Gora historical site are witnessing the fact that the locals were cultivating vines here around 8000 years ago.\nHow does a winery visit look like, once you're in Georgia? Of course, it's a bit of history, a bit of technology, and of course, some excellent food, drinks, songs, and toasts. Take a tour in Giuaani Winery in Manavi (Kakheti), discover more about the Georgian wine, and attend the friendly Georgian supra with the international visitors afterward!\nOf course, this is a demo version that gives you an idea about a half a day winery tour - it takes only one hour to get there from Tbilisi. But a deeper immersion will take you a bit longer. More wineries, more tastings, more exciting landscapes... Georgia is very diverse!", "short_description": "Visit Giuaani Winery in Kakheti with Trails and Wines, and learn more about the Georgian wine and winemaking peculiarities"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": null, "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "VRex Immersive Inc.", "support_website_url": "http://vr-ex.com/", "website_url": "http://vr-ex.com/", "category": "APPS", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["EXPERIENCE_360_NON_GAME", "TRAVEL", "EXPLORATION"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "